cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization in your work, please cite it as the software artifact and cite the paper it formalizes."
title: "FCC: a Lean 4 + mathlib formalization of Function-Correcting Codes With Data Protection"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 + mathlib formalization of the definitions, numbered results and
  proofs of Rajput, Rajan, Freij-Hollanti and Hollanti, "Function-Correcting
  Codes With Data Protection" (IEEE Trans. Inform. Theory 72(7), 2026),
  following the layout, documentation and verification conventions of Shenghao
  Yang's n4code_lean_dev project.  Includes a paper-to-Lean notation dictionary
  and consistency checkers.
